        <div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>
        <div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.25;">This press release contains forward-looking information or forward-looking statements under applicable Canadian and U.S. securities laws (collectively, &#8220;forward-looking statements&#8221;). All
